    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Odch\u00e1dzaj\u00face kan\u00e1ly", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Udalosti zost\u00e1vaj\u00fa v aplik\u00e1cii;ak chcete, po\u0161lite rovnak\u00e9 upozornenie do centra upozornen\u00ed v\u00e1\u0161ho telef\u00f3nu alebo do telegramu.\u017diadna z t\u00fdchto mo\u017enost\u00ed sa nevy\u017eaduje.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Zadajte n\u00e1zov t\u00e9my \u2013 nie je potrebn\u00fd \u017eiadny \u00fa\u010det", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "T\u00e9ma", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Ozn\u00e1menia s\u00fa zverejnen\u00e9 na t\u00fato t\u00e9mu na ntfy.sh;ak pozn\u00e1te n\u00e1zov t\u00e9my, dost\u00e1vate ho iba vy.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "Email", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Upozornenia sa odosielaj\u00fa na e-mailov\u00fa adresu v\u00e1\u0161ho \u00fa\u010dtu", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Odoslan\u00e9 na va\u0161u vlastn\u00fa adresu pri prihl\u00e1sen\u00ed;v aplik\u00e1cii nie s\u00fa ulo\u017een\u00e9 \u017eiadne tajomstv\u00e1.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Pr\u00edjemca", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Upozornenia naprie\u010d zariadeniami", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "Upozornenie \u010dlena rodiny prich\u00e1dza do centra upozornen\u00ed, aj ke\u010f je aplik\u00e1cia zatvoren\u00e1", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Prejde do oznamovac\u00edch centier ostatn\u00fdch \u010dlenov a va\u0161ich ostatn\u00fdch zariaden\u00ed;pr\u00edjemca mus\u00ed ma\u0165 na svojom zariaden\u00ed povolen\u00fd tento kan\u00e1l.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "POST JSON na v\u00e1\u0161 vlastn\u00fd server \u2013 pokro\u010dil\u00e9", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Akceptuje sa iba HTTPS;ka\u017ed\u00e1 udalos\u0165 sa odosiela ako {zdroj, id, n\u00e1zov, podrobnosti, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
    "Bot anahtar\u0131": "Token robota", // EN: Bot token
    "Sohbet ID": "ID rozhovoru", // EN: Chat ID
    "Bot anahtar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda kal\u0131r": "Token robota zost\u00e1va iba v tomto zariaden\u00ed", // EN: The bot token stays on this device only
    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Token sa nikdy neodovzd\u00e1va do cloudu;znova ho zadajte na in\u00fdch zariadeniach.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
