    "Aboneli\u011fin hemen sona erer ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "Va\u0161e predplatn\u00e9 sa okam\u017eite skon\u010d\u00ed a \u017eiadna \u010fal\u0161ia platba sa neprijme.", // EN: Your subscription ends immediately and no further payment is taken.
