    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Nem\u00e1te predplatn\u00e9 \u2013 ka\u017ed\u00e1 funkcia je moment\u00e1lne bezplatn\u00e1.NEXUS+ pr\u00edde \u010doskoro.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
