    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "Ak pozn\u00e1te adresu, nap\u00ed\u0161te ju;ak nie, ponechajte predponu siete smerova\u010da (napr\u00edklad 192.168.1) \u2013 NEXUS skontroluje v\u0161etk\u00fdch 254 adries.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
