    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu. Okunmayan bir de\u011fer varsa \"Durum okunmad\u0131\" yazar.": "Posledn\u00fd zn\u00e1my stav va\u0161ich zariaden\u00ed.Hodnota, ktor\u00e1 nebola na\u010d\u00edtan\u00e1, zobrazuje \u201eStav nepre\u010d\u00edtan\u00fd\u201c.", // EN: Last known state of your devices. A value that was not read shows "State not read".
    "A\u00c7IK G\u00d6R\u00dcNEN C\u0130HAZLAR": "ZARIADENIA, KTOR\u00c9 SA ZOBRAZUJ\u00da", // EN: DEVICES THAT APPEAR ON
