    "Durum okunmad\u0131": "\u0160t\u00e1t nepre\u010d\u00edtan\u00fd", // EN: State not read
    "Bu zaten \u015fu an kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131n e-posta adresi. Farkl\u0131 bir adres gir.": "Toto je u\u017e e-mailov\u00e1 adresa, ktor\u00fa pou\u017e\u00edvate.Zadajte in\u00fd.", // EN: This is already the email address you are using. Enter a different one.
    "Bu e-posta adresi ba\u015fka bir hesapta kay\u0131tl\u0131. Ba\u015fka bir adres dene.": "T\u00e1to e-mailov\u00e1 adresa je zaregistrovan\u00e1 na inom \u00fa\u010dte.Sk\u00faste in\u00fd.", // EN: This email address is registered to another account. Try a different one.
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denendi. Birka\u00e7 dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "Pr\u00edli\u0161 ve\u013ea pokusov.Sk\u00faste to znova o nieko\u013eko min\u00fat.", // EN: Too many attempts. Try again in a few minutes.
    "\u00c7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131": "Offline", // EN: Offline
    "Hedef okunmad\u0131": "Cie\u013e nebol pre\u010d\u00edtan\u00fd", // EN: Target not read
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm verisi yok": "\u017diadne \u00fadaje o meran\u00ed", // EN: No measurement data
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar hen\u00fcz s\u0131cakl\u0131k, nem veya hava kalitesi verisi vermedi. Sens\u00f6r\u00fcn a\u00e7\u0131k ve a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Va\u0161e zariadenia zatia\u013e nenahl\u00e1sili teplotu, vlhkos\u0165 ani kvalitu vzduchu.Skontrolujte, \u010di je senzor zapnut\u00fd a pripojen\u00fd k sieti.", // EN: Your devices have not reported temperature, humidity or air quality yet. Make sure the sensor is on and on the network.
    "Son okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler": "Najnov\u0161ie \u00fadaje", // EN: Latest readings
    "Skor \u00fcretmiyoruz; yaln\u0131zca cihazlardan okunan ger\u00e7ek de\u011ferler g\u00f6sterilir.": "Neprodukujeme sk\u00f3re;zobrazuj\u00fa sa iba skuto\u010dn\u00e9 hodnoty na\u010d\u00edtan\u00e9 z va\u0161ich zariaden\u00ed.", // EN: We do not produce a score; only real values read from your devices are shown.
    "Haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 bitirdi\u011finde \u015fu cihazlara uygulan\u0131r.": "Po dokon\u010den\u00ed sa to pou\u017eije na nasleduj\u00face zariadenia.", // EN: When you finish, this is applied to the following devices.
    "Uyku haz\u0131rl\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun cihaz yok": "\u017diadne vhodn\u00e9 zariadenie na pr\u00edpravu sp\u00e1nku", // EN: No suitable device for sleep preparation
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, kilit veya iklim cihaz\u0131 ekledi\u011finde haz\u0131rl\u0131k burada listelenir.": "Po pridan\u00ed svetla, z\u00e1vesu, z\u00e1mku alebo klimatiza\u010dn\u00e9ho zariadenia je pr\u00edprava uveden\u00e1 tu.", // EN: Once you add a light, curtain, lock or climate device, the preparation is listed here.
    "\u0130klim cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n son bilinen durumu ve okunan \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcmler.": "Posledn\u00fd zn\u00e1my stav a hodnoty va\u0161ich klimatick\u00fdch zariaden\u00ed.", // EN: Last known state and readings of your climate devices.
    "Kamera gizlili\u011fi": "S\u00fakromie fotoapar\u00e1tu", // EN: Camera privacy
    "Her kameran\u0131n gizlilik modunu ayr\u0131 ayr\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Spravujte re\u017eim s\u00fakromia ka\u017edej kamery samostatne.", // EN: Manage each camera's privacy mode separately.
    "Kamera cihaz\u0131 yok": "\u017diadne kamerov\u00e9 zariadenie", // EN: No camera device
    "Kamera ekledi\u011finde gizlilik modu her kamera i\u00e7in burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Po pridan\u00ed kamery sa tu zobraz\u00ed jej re\u017eim s\u00fakromia.", // EN: Once you add a camera, its privacy mode appears here.
    "Bu senaryoyu uygulayacak uygun cihaz yok": "\u017diadne vhodn\u00e9 zariadenie na spustenie tohto scen\u00e1ra", // EN: No suitable device to run this scenario
    "I\u015f\u0131k, perde, klima veya kilit gibi uyumlu bir cihaz ekledi\u011finde burada listelenir.": "Ke\u010f prid\u00e1te kompatibiln\u00e9 zariadenie, ako je svetlo, z\u00e1ves, klimatiz\u00e1cia alebo z\u00e1mok, zobraz\u00ed sa tu.", // EN: Once you add a compatible device such as a light, curtain, air conditioner or lock, it is listed here.
