    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "R\u00fdchla \u00faspora pre inteligentn\u00e9 z\u00e1suvky a energeticky zameran\u00e9 zariadenia.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Spojte inteligentn\u00e9 z\u00e1str\u010dky a energeticky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 zariadenia na jednom mieste.Vytvorte si profily okam\u017eit\u00e9ho ukladania a pl\u00e1novan\u00e9 ekologick\u00e9 akcie.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Vytvorte energeticky \u00fasporn\u00fd panel, ktor\u00fd spravuje inteligentn\u00e9 z\u00e1str\u010dky a energeticky n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9 zariadenia.Pridajte r\u00fdchle vypnutie, ekologick\u00e9 profily, pl\u00e1novan\u00e9 ukladanie a s\u00fahrny pou\u017e\u00edvania.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
