    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Po zadan\u00ed svojich \u00fadajov m\u00f4\u017eete heslo jednoducho obnovi\u0165 pod\u013ea pokynov, ktor\u00e9 v\u00e1m po\u0161leme.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Pou\u017eite po\u010d\u00edta\u010dov\u00fa aplik\u00e1ciu NEXUS na po\u010d\u00edta\u010di;ten ist\u00fd asistent a ovl\u00e1danie tam funguje tie\u017e.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131ndan da sohbet et; konu\u015fmalar\u0131n t\u00fcm cihazlar\u0131nda senkronize kal\u0131r.": "Chatujte aj z po\u010d\u00edta\u010da;va\u0161e konverz\u00e1cie zostan\u00fa synchronizovan\u00e9 medzi va\u0161imi zariadeniami.", // EN: Chat from your computer too; your conversations stay in sync across your devices.
    "Bir Eve Kat\u0131l": "Pripojte sa k domovu", // EN: Join a Home
    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f sa zariadenie zapne alebo vypne", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Klepnut\u00edm na zariadenie otvor\u00edte obrazovku ovl\u00e1dania panela;zobrazuje iba funkcie, ktor\u00e9 zariadenie podporuje.Pri zariadeniach Shelly, WLED a ESPHome zapnutie/vypnutie a jas id\u00fa priamo do zariadenia.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Tento k\u00f3d sa pou\u017e\u00edva na obrazovke Pripoji\u0165 sa na plochu.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
    "Bir kez dokunman\u0131z yeterli": "Sta\u010d\u00ed jedno \u0165uknutie", // EN: One tap is all it takes
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturdu\u011funda saat ve aksiyonlar burada ger\u00e7ek verilerle g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Po vytvoren\u00ed pl\u00e1nu sa tu zobrazia \u010dasy a akcie so skuto\u010dn\u00fdmi \u00fadajmi.", // EN: Once you create a plan, times and actions will appear here with real data.
    "Bir plan olu\u015fturunca burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Zobraz\u00ed sa tu, ke\u010f vytvor\u00edte pl\u00e1n.", // EN: It will appear here once you create a plan.
    "Bir sorun mu var? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Stalo sa nie\u010do?Odosla\u0165 sp\u00e4tn\u00fa v\u00e4zbu", // EN: Something wrong? Send feedback
