    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento 8-miestny k\u00f3d sl\u00fa\u017ei na p\u00e1rovanie Apple HomeKit a funguje iba s aplik\u00e1ciou Apple Home.Ak zariadenie podporuje lok\u00e1lne API, ako je Shelly, WLED alebo Tasmota, m\u00f4\u017eete ho prida\u0165 z va\u0161ej lok\u00e1lnej siete.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Toto zariadenie", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento QR k\u00f3d patr\u00ed sieti Wi-Fi, nie zariadeniu.Po pripojen\u00ed zariadenia k rovnakej sieti ho m\u00f4\u017eete prida\u0165 z lok\u00e1lnej siete.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Na tejto adrese sa nena\u0161lo \u017eiadne zn\u00e1me zariadenie NEXUS.Uistite sa, \u017ee je zariadenie zapnut\u00e9 a v rovnakej sieti.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Vytvorte t\u00fato inteligentn\u00fa aplik\u00e1ciu:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Pripravuj\u00fa sa navrhovan\u00e9 funkcie pre tento tok.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Ulo\u017een\u00e9 tento mesiac", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "V tejto sieti sa nena\u0161lo \u017eiadne podporovan\u00e9 zariadenie.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "V tejto sieti sa nena\u0161lo \u017eiadne podporovan\u00e9 zariadenie.Uistite sa, \u017ee je zariadenie zapnut\u00e9 a pripojen\u00e9 k rovnakej sieti Wi-Fi;inak pou\u017eite ni\u017e\u0161ie uveden\u00fd katal\u00f3g alebo QR / nastavovac\u00ed k\u00f3d.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Lok\u00e1lna ochrana tohto zariadenia", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Toto zariadenie nezdie\u013ea inform\u00e1cie o verzii", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Toto zariadenie alebo pripojenie nepodporuje baterku.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Toto zariadenie nepodporuje automatick\u00e9 ur\u010dovanie polohy.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "Tento poz\u00fdvac\u00ed k\u00f3d sa nena\u0161iel.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "T\u00e1to obrazovka zoskupuje osvet\u013eovacie zariadenia, ktor\u00e9 ste pridali, pod\u013ea miestnosti;ke\u010f sc\u00e9nu ulo\u017e\u00edte, jas a t\u00f3n sa nastavia spolu.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Tu s\u00fa uveden\u00e9 zariadenia, ktor\u00e9 prid\u00e1te do tejto dom\u00e1cnosti.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Zariadenia, ktor\u00e9 prid\u00e1te do tejto dom\u00e1cnosti, s\u00fa uveden\u00e9 tu a prepojen\u00e9 s va\u0161imi ob\u013e\u00faben\u00fdmi kartami.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Naozaj chcete natrvalo odstr\u00e1ni\u0165 t\u00fato dom\u00e1cnos\u0165 a v\u0161etky jej nastavenia?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Tento k\u00f3d nie je podporovan\u00fd k\u00f3d zariadenia.Ak pozn\u00e1te IP adresu zariadenia, m\u00f4\u017eete ju prida\u0165 z lok\u00e1lnej siete.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Tieto zna\u010dky s\u00fa riaden\u00e9 va\u0161ou lok\u00e1lnou sie\u0165ou", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "T\u00fato mini aplik\u00e1ciu poskytuje ofici\u00e1lny poskytovate\u013e.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Toto prostredie nepodporuje pr\u00edstup k fotoapar\u00e1tu.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "Sie\u0165ov\u00e9 skenovanie tu nie je dostupn\u00e9.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "V tomto prostred\u00ed neexistuje \u017eiadne bezpe\u010dn\u00e9 \u0161ifrovanie", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Ke\u010f sa spust\u00ed tento scen\u00e1r, s\u00favisiace zariadenia sa nastavia automaticky.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Tento scen\u00e1r neovplyv\u0148uje \u017eiadne zariadenia \u2013 najsk\u00f4r pridajte vhodn\u00e9 zariadenie.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Ak chcete pou\u017ei\u0165 tento scen\u00e1r, mus\u00edte prida\u0165 kompatibiln\u00e9 zariadenie.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Toto je v\u00e1\u0161 jedin\u00fd domov.Ak ho vyma\u017eete, op\u00e4\u0165 sa vytvor\u00ed pr\u00e1zdny \u201eM\u00f4j domov\u201c.Pokra\u010dova\u0165?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
