    "Buluta ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Nepodarilo sa dosiahnu\u0165 cloud.Skontrolujte svoje internetov\u00e9 pripojenie.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud. Check your internet connection.
    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Nevedel som to \u00faplne vyrie\u0161i\u0165.Po\u0161lite sp\u00e4tn\u00fa v\u00e4zbu n\u00e1\u0161mu t\u00edmu pomocou formul\u00e1ra ni\u017e\u0161ie a my sa v\u00e1m ozveme hne\u010f, ako to bude mo\u017en\u00e9, alebo pokra\u010dujte pomocou \u201eOtvori\u0165 cel\u00fd \u010det\u201c.", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
