    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Spustite \u010fal\u0161ie scen\u00e1re automaticky, ke\u010f sa zmen\u00ed stav va\u0161ich zariaden\u00ed.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Z\u00edskajte preh\u013ead o svojich zariadeniach a automaticky ukladajte pomocou strat\u00e9gi\u00ed.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "Svoje zariadenia m\u00f4\u017eete prida\u0165 s automatick\u00fdm skenovan\u00edm, QR k\u00f3dom, nastavovac\u00edm k\u00f3dom alebo manu\u00e1lnym katal\u00f3gom.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Z\u00edskajte preh\u013ead o svojich zariadeniach a energetick\u00e9 tipy.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
