    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "Odstr\u00e1\u0148te zariadenie", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Pre\u010do sa moje zariadenie zobrazuje ako offline?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Zadajte IP adresu zariadenia a NEXUS zist\u00ed, ktor\u00fd protokol hovor\u00ed.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Skontrolujte pripojenie Wi-Fi zariadenia a smerova\u010d.Ak probl\u00e9m pretrv\u00e1va, odstr\u00e1\u0148te zariadenie a znova ho pridajte.Postup: Zariadenia > vyberte zariadenie > Odstr\u00e1ni\u0165.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Skontrolujte pripojenie Wi-Fi zariadenia a smerova\u010d.Ak probl\u00e9m pretrv\u00e1va, odstr\u00e1\u0148te zariadenie z aplik\u00e1cie NEXUS a znova ho pridajte.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ak sa va\u0161e zariadenie nezobraz\u00ed, pou\u017eite skenovanie QR k\u00f3dov alebo k\u00f3d nastavenia.M\u00f4\u017eete otvori\u0165 str\u00e1nku pomocn\u00edka, kde z\u00edskate podporu a pokyny.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "Slu\u017eba ur\u010dovania polohy (GPS) v\u00e1\u0161ho zariadenia je vypnut\u00e1.Zapnite ho a sk\u00faste to znova.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "Va\u0161e zariadenie nepodporuje lokaliza\u010dn\u00e9 slu\u017eby.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
