    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Vypnite v\u0161etky skupiny osvetlenia, ktor\u00e9 zostali doma.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "Doma a pre\u010d", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Pre\u010d", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Ke\u010f pre\u010d", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "Spravujte svetl\u00e1 vo svojej dom\u00e1cej izbe po miestnosti jedn\u00fdm pohybom.Zapnutie/vypnutie, jas, teplota farieb a r\u00fdchle skratky sc\u00e9n v jednej aplik\u00e1cii.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Poskytujte pripraven\u00e9 pr\u00edkazy, r\u00fdchle automatiz\u00e1cie a n\u00e1vrhy inteligentn\u00fdch aplik\u00e1ci\u00ed na z\u00e1klade zariaden\u00ed v dom\u00e1cnosti.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Vytvorte aplik\u00e1ciu pre klimatick\u00fd komfort, ktor\u00e1 spravuje klimatiz\u00e1ciu a termostaty vo va\u0161ej dom\u00e1cnosti z jedn\u00e9ho panela.Zah\u0155\u0148a ovl\u00e1danie teploty, r\u00fdchle re\u017eimy, ekologick\u00fd re\u017eim a akcie v miestnosti.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "Ak\u00fd je stav mojich zariaden\u00ed?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "\u010ealeko od domova", // EN: Away from Home
