    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Zabal\u00ed energetick\u00e9 a bezpe\u010dnostn\u00e9 kontroly, ke\u010f opust\u00edte domov.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "\u010ealeko od domova", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Odchod z domova", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Op\u00fa\u0161\u0165am domovsk\u00fa kontrolu", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Odchod z dom\u00e1cej sc\u00e9ny", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "S\u00fahrn odchodu z domova", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Dokon\u010di\u0165 odchod z domu", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Vytvorte aplik\u00e1ciu na kontrolu odchodu z domu, ktor\u00e1 zobrazuje ponechan\u00e9 zariadenia, stav uzamknutia a nastavenia energie na jednej obrazovke.Pridajte tla\u010didl\u00e1 r\u00fdchleho vypnutia a aktiv\u00e1cie zabezpe\u010denia.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "Pri odchode z domu jedn\u00fdm pohybom skontrolujte zariadenia, ktor\u00e9 zostali zapnut\u00e9, z\u00e1mky a stav energie.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Pri odchode z domu zobrazte na jednej obrazovke zapnut\u00e9 zariadenia, z\u00e1mky a stav energie.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Pozrite si na jednom paneli svetl\u00e1, z\u00e1str\u010dky, AC a bezpe\u010dnostn\u00e9 nastavenia, ktor\u00e9 zostali zapnut\u00e9 pred odchodom z domu.Zhroma\u017edite kroky r\u00fdchleho vypnutia a aktiv\u00e1cie zabezpe\u010denia do jedn\u00e9ho postupu.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Pred odchodom urobme posledn\u00e9 kontroly.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Automatick\u00e9 vypnutie svetiel po odchode...", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Po opusten\u00ed domu automaticky vypnite svetl\u00e1", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Po odchode automaticky vypnite svetl\u00e1 a zapnite ich, ke\u010f sa vr\u00e1tite.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Vyp\u00ednajte klimatiz\u00e1ciu automaticky, ke\u010f nikto nie je doma, a vyhnete sa tak zbyto\u010dnej spotrebe.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Automaticky vypnite nap\u00e1janie zariaden\u00ed v pohotovostnom re\u017eime v \u010dase, ktor\u00fd si zvol\u00edte v noci.", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
