    "Evet, \u0130ptal Et": "\u00c1no, zru\u0161i\u0165", // EN: Yes, Cancel
    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "\u00e1no.NEXUS je lok\u00e1lny;\u00fadaje v\u00e1\u0161ho zariadenia zostan\u00fa v tomto zariaden\u00ed a nezdie\u013eaj\u00fa sa s tret\u00edmi stranami.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
