    "Bu hafta kayda de\u011fer bir etkinlik yok. Senaryo \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmalar\u0131 ve uyar\u0131lar burada toplan\u0131r.": "Tento t\u00fd\u017ede\u0148 \u017eiadna v\u00fdrazn\u00e1 aktivita.Tu be\u017e\u00ed sc\u00e9na a zhroma\u017e\u010fuj\u00fa sa upozornenia.", // EN: No notable activity this week. Scene runs and alerts gather here.
    "Al\u0131\u015fveri\u015f listesi, ev i\u015fleri ya da k\u0131sa notlar \u2014 ailenle payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n ilk maddeyi ekle.": "N\u00e1kupn\u00fd zoznam, dom\u00e1ce pr\u00e1ce alebo r\u00fdchle pozn\u00e1mky \u2013 pridajte prv\u00fa polo\u017eku, ktor\u00fa chcete zdie\u013ea\u0165 so svojou rodinou.", // EN: Shopping list, chores or quick notes — add the first item to share with your family.
    "Ev Panosu evin \u00fcyeleri aras\u0131ndad\u0131r. Ev Y\u00f6netimi'nden ev olu\u015ftur ya da davetle kat\u0131l.": "Spr\u00e1vna rada patr\u00ed \u010dlenom v\u00e1\u0161ho domova.Vytvorte si dom\u00e1cnos\u0165 v Spr\u00e1ve dom\u00e1cnosti alebo sa pripojte pozv\u00e1nkou.", // EN: The board belongs to your home's members. Create a home from Home Management or join by invite.
    "Bu madde panodan t\u00fcm \u00fcyeler i\u00e7in kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r.": "T\u00e1to polo\u017eka je odstr\u00e1nen\u00e1 z n\u00e1stenky pre v\u0161etk\u00fdch \u010dlenov.", // EN: This item is removed from the board for all members.
