    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Prid\u00e1vanie zariaden\u00ed Matter vy\u017eaduje ovl\u00e1da\u010d Matter, ktor\u00fd NEXUS zatia\u013e nepon\u00faka.Ak sa zariadenie prip\u00e1ja cez Wi-Fi, m\u00f4\u017eete ho prida\u0165 z miestnej siete pod\u013ea jeho IP adresy.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
