    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "NEXUS AI sa u\u010d\u00ed va\u0161e n\u00e1vyky a premen\u00ed v\u00e1\u0161 domov na obytn\u00fd priestor vytvoren\u00fd pr\u00e1ve pre v\u00e1s.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
