    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Pripoji\u0165 sa m\u00f4\u017eete zadan\u00edm tohto k\u00f3du v \u010dasti \u201eJoin a Home\u201c v NEXUS.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "Spustite svoje scen\u00e1re NEXUS hlasom so Siri v priebehu nieko\u013ek\u00fdch sek\u00fand.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS je predov\u0161etk\u00fdm lok\u00e1lny: \u00fadaje v\u00e1\u0161ho zariadenia zostan\u00fa na tomto zariaden\u00ed, pr\u00edkazy zariadenia id\u00fa priamo cez va\u0161u miestnu sie\u0165 a ni\u010d sa nezdie\u013ea s tret\u00edmi stranami.", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
