    "NEXUS'u di\u011fer platformlara ba\u011flayarak cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 her yerden kontrol et.": "Pripojte NEXUS k in\u00fdm platform\u00e1m a ovl\u00e1dajte svoje zariadenia odkia\u013eko\u013evek.", // EN: Connect NEXUS to other platforms to control your devices from anywhere.
    "Bu hizmet ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 hen\u00fcz kullan\u0131labilir de\u011fil. \u00dc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraf cihazlar i\u00e7in Entegrasyonlar'dan Home Assistant'\u0131 kullanabilirsin.": "Tieto servisn\u00e9 pripojenia zatia\u013e nie s\u00fa dostupn\u00e9.Pre zariadenia tret\u00edch str\u00e1n m\u00f4\u017eete pou\u017ei\u0165 Home Assistant od Integrations.", // EN: These service connections are not available yet. For third-party devices, you can use Home Assistant from Integrations.
    "NEXUS+ Ayl\u0131k": "NEXUS+ mesa\u010dne", // EN: NEXUS+ Monthly
    "NEXUS+ Y\u0131ll\u0131k": "NEXUS+ ro\u010dne", // EN: NEXUS+ Yearly
