    "NEXUS+ aboneli\u011fi iptal edildi": "Predplatn\u00e9 NEXUS+ bolo zru\u0161en\u00e9", // EN: NEXUS+ subscription cancelled
    "NEXUS+ hen\u00fcz sat\u0131\u015fta de\u011fil. Cihaz ekleme, kontrol panelleri, senaryolar ve NEXUS AI \u015fu an tamamen \u00fccretsiz; abonelik a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda buradan haber verece\u011fiz.": "NEXUS+ e\u0161te nie je v predaji.Prid\u00e1vanie zariaden\u00ed, scen\u00e1rov a NEXUS AI je teraz \u00faplne zadarmo;tu v\u00e1m d\u00e1me vedie\u0165, ke\u010f sa odbery otvoria.", // EN: NEXUS+ isn't on sale yet. Adding devices, scenarios and NEXUS AI are completely free right now; we'll let you know here when subscriptions open.
    "NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda": "NEXUS+ u\u017e \u010doskoro", // EN: NEXUS+ coming soon
    "NEXUS, \u00e7er\u00e7eve i\u00e7indeki kodu otomatik alg\u0131lar ve e\u015fle\u015fmeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "NEXUS automaticky rozpozn\u00e1 k\u00f3d vo vn\u00fatri r\u00e1mu a spust\u00ed p\u00e1rovanie.", // EN: NEXUS detects the code inside the frame automatically and starts pairing.
