    "Uyand\u0131rma cihaz\u0131 olarak ekle": "Prida\u0165 ako zariadenie na budenie", // EN: Add as a wake-up device
    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Na tejto adrese sa nach\u00e1dza zariadenie, ktor\u00e9 v\u0161ak nepodporuje protokol NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Toto zariadenie je u\u017e pridan\u00e9.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Sp\u00e1rujte a pridajte", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "P\u00e1rovac\u00ed k\u00f3d nie je platn\u00fd.Zadajte 11-miestny k\u00f3d alebo obsah QR, ktor\u00fd za\u010d\u00edna na MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Zadajte tento k\u00f3d v po\u010d\u00edta\u010dovej aplik\u00e1cii NEXUS.Ak je zariadenie na Wi-Fi, m\u00f4\u017eete ho prida\u0165 aj z miestnej siete pod\u013ea jeho IP adresy.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Zariadenie sa h\u013ead\u00e1 v rovnakej sieti a sp\u00e1ruje sa.M\u00f4\u017ee to trva\u0165 a\u017e min\u00fatu;zariadenie mus\u00ed by\u0165 zapnut\u00e9 a v re\u017eime p\u00e1rovania.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Zariadenie sa nena\u0161lo alebo ho nebolo mo\u017en\u00e9 sp\u00e1rova\u0165.Uistite sa, \u017ee je v rovnakej sieti, je zapnut\u00fd a v re\u017eime p\u00e1rovania.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Zariadenie sa nena\u0161lo.Uistite sa, \u017ee je v rovnakej sieti, je zapnut\u00fd a v re\u017eime p\u00e1rovania.Firewall v\u00e1\u0161ho po\u010d\u00edta\u010da m\u00f4\u017ee blokova\u0165 odpovede zo zariaden\u00ed v lok\u00e1lnej sieti.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Zariadenie sa nepodarilo sp\u00e1rova\u0165.Skontrolujte p\u00e1rovac\u00ed k\u00f3d a \u010di je zariadenie v re\u017eime p\u00e1rovania.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Zariadenie je sp\u00e1rovan\u00e9, ale nem\u00e1 \u017eiadnu funkciu, ktor\u00fa m\u00f4\u017ee NEXUS ovl\u00e1da\u0165.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Zariadenie nereagovalo.Uistite sa, \u017ee je zapnut\u00e1 a v rovnakej sieti.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
