    "QR okunamazsa, a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki manuel ekleme se\u00e7ene\u011fiyle kodu elle girin.": "Ak sa QR ned\u00e1 pre\u010d\u00edta\u0165, zadajte k\u00f3d manu\u00e1lne pomocou mo\u017enosti manu\u00e1lne ni\u017e\u0161ie.", // EN: If the QR can't be read, enter the code manually with the manual option below.
    "QR tarama, kurulum kodu ve manuel katalog ile cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 ger\u00e7ek ak\u0131\u015f \u00fczerinden ekleyebilirsin.": "Svoje zariadenia m\u00f4\u017eete prida\u0165 automatick\u00fdm skenovan\u00edm, QR k\u00f3dom, nastavovac\u00edm k\u00f3dom alebo manu\u00e1lnym katal\u00f3gom.", // EN: You can add your devices by automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
