    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Skombinujte telev\u00edzor, medi\u00e1lny box a okolit\u00e9 osvetlenie v jednej akcii.U\u013eah\u010dite si nastavenie spustenia filmu, no\u010dn\u00e9ho re\u017eimu a z\u00e1bavn\u00fdch sc\u00e9n bez rozpty\u013eovania.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Samozrejme!M\u00f4\u017eem pre v\u00e1s zostavi\u0165 skvel\u00fd inteligentn\u00fd scen\u00e1r.Mohli by ste mi poskytn\u00fa\u0165 p\u00e1r podrobnost\u00ed?Napr\u00edklad: \u201eZapnite k\u00e1vovar, ke\u010f sa zobud\u00edm\u201c alebo \u201e\u00daplne stlmte svetl\u00e1, ke\u010f pozer\u00e1m film\u201c.", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
