    "Uyan\u0131nca \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, iklim ve m\u00fczi\u011fi tek dokunu\u015fla ba\u015flat.": "Spustite svetl\u00e1, \u017eal\u00fazie, kl\u00edmu a hudbu jedin\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm, ke\u010f sa zobud\u00edte.", // EN: Start lights, blinds, climate and music with one tap when you wake up.
    "Kap\u0131dan girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar, iklim ve m\u00fczik seni kar\u015f\u0131las\u0131n.": "Svetl\u00e1, kl\u00edma a hudba v\u00e1s priv\u00edtaj\u00fa, ke\u010f vst\u00fapite.", // EN: Lights, climate and music greet you as you walk in.
    "Ev bo\u015fken tasarruf, taklit hareket ve uyar\u0131 tek panelde.": "\u00daspory, simulovan\u00e1 pr\u00edtomnos\u0165 a upozornenia na jednom paneli, ke\u010f je dom pr\u00e1zdny.", // EN: Savings, simulated presence and alerts in one panel while the home is empty.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrge ve temizlik cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in g\u00fcn ve oda plan\u0131.": "Pl\u00e1ny dn\u00ed a miestnost\u00ed pre robotick\u00e9 vys\u00e1va\u010de a \u010distiace zariadenia.", // EN: Day and room plans for robot vacuums and cleaning devices.
    "Sulama saatleri, b\u00f6lgeler ve sens\u00f6r verisiyle ak\u0131ll\u0131 plan.": "Inteligentn\u00e9 zavla\u017eovacie pl\u00e1ny, z\u00f3ny a pl\u00e1novanie na z\u00e1klade senzorov.", // EN: Smart watering schedules, zones and sensor-driven planning.
    "Sens\u00f6r verisiyle havaland\u0131rma ve temizleyiciyi otomatik y\u00f6net.": "Spravujte ventil\u00e1ciu a \u010disti\u010dky automaticky z \u00fadajov senzorov.", // EN: Manage ventilation and purifiers automatically from sensor data.
    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken sessizlik, do\u011fru \u0131\u015f\u0131k ve bildirim aras\u0131.": "Tich\u00e9, spr\u00e1vne osvetlenie a \u017eiadne preru\u0161enia pri pr\u00e1ci.", // EN: Quiet, proper lighting and no interruptions while you work.
