    "Yatak odas\u0131": "Sp\u00e1l\u0148a", // EN: Bedroom
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Zhroma\u017edite v\u0161etky dom\u00e1ce \u0161eky, ktor\u00e9 potrebujete pred span\u00edm, v jednom centre.Stlmenie svetiel, neru\u0161i\u0165, kontrola uzamknutia a nastavenie no\u010dnej kl\u00edmy na jednej obrazovke.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Vytvorte si centrum na pr\u00edpravu pred span\u00edm, ktor\u00e9 riadi svetl\u00e1, tich\u00fd re\u017eim, z\u00e1mky a kl\u00edmu pred span\u00edm.Pridajte z\u00e1vere\u010dn\u00fd s\u00fahrn kontroly a no\u010dn\u00fd re\u017eim jedn\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
