    "\u00d6nce bir senaryo se\u00e7.": "Najprv vyberte sc\u00e9nu.", // EN: Choose a scene first.
    "Kaydetmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce ev konumunu se\u00e7.": "Najprv vyberte miesto svojho domova, ktor\u00e9 chcete ulo\u017ei\u0165.", // EN: Choose your home location first to save.
    "Cihaz Se\u00e7": "Vyberte Zariadenia", // EN: Choose Devices
    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Otvorte t\u00fato obrazovku v aplik\u00e1cii NEXUS na va\u0161om iPhone;va\u0161e sc\u00e9ny s\u00fa uveden\u00e9 ni\u017e\u0161ie a pre ka\u017ed\u00fa z nich m\u00f4\u017eete nastavi\u0165 skratku Siri.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Skop\u00edrujte odkaz na sc\u00e9nu", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Tento odkaz otvor\u00ed NEXUS a okam\u017eite spust\u00ed sc\u00e9nu.", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. Vytvorte nov\u00fa skratku v Skratk\u00e1ch", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Vyberte \u201ePrida\u0165 akciu\u201c \u203a \u201eOtvori\u0165 adresy URL\u201c a prilepte skop\u00edrovan\u00fd odkaz.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
    "Kestirmeler uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7": "Otvorte aplik\u00e1ciu Skratky", // EN: Open the Shortcuts app
    "Cihazlar\u0131na uyan haz\u0131r otomasyonlardan birini tek dokunu\u015fla ekle.": "Pridajte hotov\u00fa automatiz\u00e1ciu, ktor\u00e1 sa hod\u00ed pre va\u0161e zariadenia jedin\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Add a ready-made automation that fits your devices with one tap.
    "Belirli bir saatte; her g\u00fcn, hafta i\u00e7i ya da hafta sonu": "V stanovenom \u010dase;ka\u017ed\u00fd de\u0148, v pracovn\u00e9 dni alebo cez v\u00edkendy", // EN: At a set time; every day, on weekdays or at weekends
    "G\u00fcn Do\u011fumu / Bat\u0131m\u0131": "V\u00fdchod / z\u00e1pad slnka", // EN: Sunrise / Sunset
    "Ev konumuna g\u00f6re g\u00fcne\u015f do\u011farken ya da batarken": "Pri v\u00fdchode alebo z\u00e1pade slnka pre miesto v\u00e1\u0161ho domova", // EN: At sunrise or sunset for your home location
    "Cihaz ve Sens\u00f6r": "Zariadenia a senzory", // EN: Devices & Sensors
    "Hareket Alg\u0131land\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f sa zist\u00ed pohyb", // EN: When Motion Is Detected
    "Hareket sens\u00f6r\u00fc bir hareket alg\u0131lad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f pohybov\u00fd senzor zaznamen\u00e1 pohyb", // EN: When a motion sensor detects movement
    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f sa otvoria dvere alebo okno", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f sa otvor\u00ed dverov\u00fd/okenn\u00fd senzor", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Ke\u010f senzor dymu, z\u00e1plavy alebo plynu spust\u00ed alarm", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Po pridan\u00ed vhodn\u00e9ho zariadenia sa tu objavia sp\u00fa\u0161\u0165a\u010de zariaden\u00ed a senzorov.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Domov a okolie", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Ke\u010f teplota, vietor alebo d\u00e1\u017e\u010f prekro\u010d\u00ed prah", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
