    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Ve\u010dera", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Otvorte z\u00e1vesy", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Zamknite dvere", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Rozsvieti ka\u017ed\u00e9 svetlo na pln\u00fd jas.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Vyp\u00edna ka\u017ed\u00e9 svetlo.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Zapne svetl\u00e1 na pln\u00fd jas v t\u00f3ne denn\u00e9ho svetla.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Nastav\u00ed svetl\u00e1 na 85 % v neutr\u00e1lnom t\u00f3ne a vypne TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Nastav\u00ed svetl\u00e1 na 40 % v teplom t\u00f3ne.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd ve\u010der o 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Zapne klimatiz\u00e1ciu pri 20\u00b0 a nastav\u00ed termostat na 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Nastav\u00ed termostat na komfortn\u00e9 nastavenie 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Pracovn\u00e9 dni 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Otv\u00e1ra ka\u017ed\u00fd z\u00e1ves a roletu.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd de\u0148 pri v\u00fdchode slnka", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Zatvor\u00ed ka\u017ed\u00fd z\u00e1ves a roletu.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Ka\u017ed\u00fd de\u0148 pri z\u00e1pade slnka", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Zamkne ka\u017ed\u00fd inteligentn\u00fd z\u00e1mok (z\u00e1mky sa nikdy neodomkn\u00fa).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Vypne svetl\u00e1 a telev\u00edzor;ponech\u00e1va z\u00e1str\u010dky a AC na pokoji.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Zapnite alebo vypnite zariadenie", // EN: Turn a device on or off
