    "Hangi cihaz?": "Ktor\u00e9 zariadenie?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Zapnite", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Vypnite", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Vyberte zariadenie, ktor\u00e9 chcete ovl\u00e1da\u0165.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Pozrite si kvalitu vzduchu, teplotu a vlhkos\u0165, ktor\u00e9 va\u0161e senzory meraj\u00fa a riadia va\u0161u \u010disti\u010dku.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Pripravte svetl\u00e1, z\u00e1vesy a klimatiz\u00e1ciu na de\u0148 jedin\u00fdm klepnut\u00edm.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Ke\u010f pr\u00eddete domov, spolo\u010dne zapnite svetl\u00e1, z\u00e1vesy a kl\u00edmu.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Uve\u010fte svoje zariadenia do bezpe\u010dn\u00e9ho a energeticky \u00fasporn\u00e9ho stavu, ke\u010f budete dlho pre\u010d.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Stlmte svetl\u00e1, zatiahnite z\u00e1vesy a zapnite telev\u00edzor.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "Spustite robotick\u00fd vys\u00e1va\u010d alebo ho po\u0161lite sp\u00e4\u0165 do jeho doku.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Zamknite dvere, zatiahnite z\u00e1vesy a pripravte dom na noc.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Pozrite si stav a nastavenie s\u00fakromia svojich kamier na jednej obrazovke.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Zapnite alebo vypnite re\u017eim s\u00fakromia pre svoje kamery z jedn\u00e9ho miesta, ke\u010f ste doma.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Pozrite sa, ktor\u00e1 automatiz\u00e1cia be\u017e\u00ed dnes.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Zdie\u013eajte pozn\u00e1mky a \u00falohy so svojou dom\u00e1cnos\u0165ou.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Pozrite si s\u00fahrn o zdravotnom stave v\u00e1\u0161ho domova zo vzduchu, vlhkosti a teploty, ktor\u00e9 meraj\u00fa va\u0161e senzory.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
