    "\u015eifren belirlendi \u2713": "Va\u0161e heslo je nastaven\u00e9 \u2713", // EN: Your password is set ✓
    "Bu hesap Google ile a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131, i\u00e7inde hen\u00fcz bir \u015fifre yok. \u0130lk \u015fifreni burada belirleyebilirsin; bundan sonra e-posta ve \u015fifreyle de giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "Tento \u00fa\u010det bol otvoren\u00fd v slu\u017ebe Google a zatia\u013e nem\u00e1 \u017eiadne heslo.Tu si nastavte svoje prv\u00e9 heslo;potom sa m\u00f4\u017eete prihl\u00e1si\u0165 aj pomocou e-mailu a hesla.", // EN: This account was opened with Google and has no password yet. Set your first password here; after that you can also sign in with email and password.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 e-postama g\u00f6nder": "Po\u0161lite mi e-mail s odkazom na nastavenie hesla", // EN: Email me a password setup link
    "Bu i\u015flem ek do\u011frulama istiyor. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan \u015fifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 isteyebilirsin.": "T\u00e1to akcia vy\u017eaduje dodato\u010dn\u00e9 overenie.Ni\u017e\u0161ie si m\u00f4\u017eete vy\u017eiada\u0165 odkaz na nastavenie hesla.", // EN: This action needs extra verification. You can request a password setup link below.
    "\u015eifre belirleme ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 e-postana g\u00f6nderildi \u2713": "Odkaz na nastavenie hesla bol odoslan\u00fd do va\u0161ej doru\u010denej po\u0161ty \u2713", // EN: Password setup link sent to your inbox ✓
    "\u015eifre ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 \u015fu anda g\u00f6nderilemiyor.": "Odkaz na heslo moment\u00e1lne nie je mo\u017en\u00e9 odosla\u0165.", // EN: The password link can't be sent right now.
    "Giri\u015f e-postan bulunamad\u0131; \u00f6nce giri\u015f yap.": "Nepodarilo sa n\u00e1m n\u00e1js\u0165 v\u00e1\u0161 prihlasovac\u00ed e-mail.najprv sa prihl\u00e1ste.", // EN: We couldn't find your sign-in email; sign in first.
