    "Enerji Cihazlar\u0131 ekran\u0131ndaki se\u00e7imin kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Pou\u017eije sa v\u00fdber, ktor\u00fd ste urobili na obrazovke Energetick\u00e9 zariadenia.", // EN: The choice you made on the Energy Devices screen is used.
