    "Home Assistant Hareket Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "Pohybov\u00fd senzor dom\u00e1ceho asistenta", // EN: Home Assistant Motion Sensor
    "Home Assistant Kap\u0131 ve Pencere Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "Sn\u00edma\u010d dver\u00ed a okien dom\u00e1ceho asistenta", // EN: Home Assistant Door & Window Sensor
    "Home Assistant S\u0131cakl\u0131k ve Nem Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "Sn\u00edma\u010d teploty a vlhkosti Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Temperature & Humidity Sensor
    "Home Assistant Su S\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "Home Assistant Senzor \u00faniku vody", // EN: Home Assistant Water Leak Sensor
    "Home Assistant Duman Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "Detektor dymu Home Assistant", // EN: Home Assistant Smoke Detector
    "Home Assistant Gaz ve CO Dedekt\u00f6r\u00fc": "Dom\u00e1ci asistent Detektor plynu a CO", // EN: Home Assistant Gas & CO Detector
    "Home Assistant Hava Kalitesi Sens\u00f6r\u00fc": "Home Assistant Senzor kvality vzduchu", // EN: Home Assistant Air Quality Sensor
    "Yerel LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u015fifreli TCP) \u2014 \u00fccretsiz Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131nan cihaz kimli\u011fi + yerel anahtarla, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller": "Lok\u00e1lna LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u0161ifrovan\u00fd TCP) \u2014 s ID zariadenia + miestnym k\u013e\u00fa\u010dom z bezplatn\u00e9ho \u00fa\u010dtu Tuya IoT v aplik\u00e1cii pre stoln\u00e9 po\u010d\u00edta\u010de;z\u00e1str\u010dky, vyp\u00edna\u010de a \u017eiarovky", // EN: Local LAN (3.3 / 3.4, encrypted TCP) — with the device ID + local key from a free Tuya IoT account, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs
