    "eWeLink DIY modu (cihazda DIY a\u00e7\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131) \u2014 \u00e7ok kanall\u0131 modellerde her kanal ayr\u0131 cihaz": "Re\u017eim eWeLink DIY (urob si s\u00e1m na zariaden\u00ed mus\u00ed by\u0165 povolen\u00fd) \u2014 na viackan\u00e1lov\u00fdch modeloch je ka\u017ed\u00fd kan\u00e1l samostatn\u00e9 zariadenie", // EN: eWeLink DIY mode (DIY must be enabled on the device) — on multi-channel models each channel is a separate device
    "Sonoff BASICR3 R\u00f6le": "Rel\u00e9 Sonoff BASICR3", // EN: Sonoff BASICR3 Relay
    "Sonoff MINIR2 R\u00f6le": "Rel\u00e9 Sonoff MINIR2", // EN: Sonoff MINIR2 Relay
    "Sonoff 4CHPROR3 4 Kanall\u0131 R\u00f6le": "Sonoff 4CHPROR3 4-kan\u00e1lov\u00e9 rel\u00e9", // EN: Sonoff 4CHPROR3 4-Channel Relay
    "Yerel UDP \u2014 masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; yerle\u015fik sahneler dahil": "Lok\u00e1lny UDP \u2014 v aplik\u00e1cii pre stoln\u00e9 po\u010d\u00edta\u010de;vr\u00e1tane vstavan\u00fdch sc\u00e9n", // EN: Local UDP — in the desktop app; built-in scenes included
    "WiZ A60 Renkli Ampul": "Farebn\u00e1 \u017eiarovka WiZ A60", // EN: WiZ A60 Colour Bulb
    "WiZ I\u015f\u0131k \u015eeridi": "Sveteln\u00fd p\u00e1s WiZ", // EN: WiZ Light Strip
    "Yerel Open API (ba\u011flant\u0131 noktas\u0131 16021); g\u00fc\u00e7 d\u00fc\u011fmesiyle e\u015fle\u015ftirme gerekir": "Local Open API (port 16021);je potrebn\u00e9 sp\u00e1rovanie s tla\u010didlom nap\u00e1jania", // EN: Local Open API (port 16021); pairing with the power button is required
    "Nanoleaf I\u015f\u0131k Panelleri / Shapes": "Nanoleaf sveteln\u00e9 panely / tvary", // EN: Nanoleaf Light Panels / Shapes
