    "LIFX Z LED \u015eerit": "LED p\u00e1sik LIFX Z", // EN: LIFX Z LED Strip
    "Yerel UDP (Govee Home'da LAN Control a\u00e7\u0131k olmal\u0131) \u2014 masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda": "Lok\u00e1lne UDP (ovl\u00e1danie LAN mus\u00ed by\u0165 povolen\u00e9 v Govee Home) \u2014 v aplik\u00e1cii pre stoln\u00e9 po\u010d\u00edta\u010de", // EN: Local UDP (LAN Control must be enabled in Govee Home) — in the desktop app
    "Govee H6159 LED \u015eerit": "LED p\u00e1sik Govee H6159", // EN: Govee H6159 LED Strip
