    "Sonraki \u00f6deme {0} tutar\u0131nda {1} tarihinde al\u0131nacak.": "\u010eal\u0161ia platba vo v\u00fd\u0161ke {0} bude \u00fa\u010dtovan\u00e1 {1}.", // EN: Next payment of {0} will be charged on {1}.
    "A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki cihazlar internet ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 olmadan, ev a\u011f\u0131nda NEXUS'a ba\u011flan\u0131r. Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar {0} modelden se\u00e7ilir.": "Zariadenia ni\u017e\u0161ie sa prip\u00e1jaj\u00fa k zariadeniu NEXUS vo va\u0161ej dom\u00e1cej sieti bez internetov\u00e9ho pripojenia.Vyberte si z {0} modelov.", // EN: The devices below connect to NEXUS on your home network, without an internet connection. Choose from {0} models.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS dosiahne va\u0161e zariadenia priamo zo svojej vlastnej aplik\u00e1cie;nem\u00e1 vstavan\u00fd most HomeKit.Ak ich chcete pou\u017e\u00edva\u0165 s Apple Home (HomeKit), praktick\u00e1 cesta je {0}: pridajte svoje zariadenia do Home Assistant a potom povo\u013ete integr\u00e1ciu HomeKit od HA.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; it has no built-in HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; {0} yerle\u015fik bir HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc Apple Ev'e ger\u00e7ek aksesuar yay\u0131nlar (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki panelden ba\u015flat). Web/telefon s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde k\u00f6pr\u00fc yoktur.": "NEXUS dosiahne va\u0161e zariadenia priamo zo svojej vlastnej aplik\u00e1cie;na stolnom po\u010d\u00edta\u010di, {0} vstavan\u00fd HomeKit bridge zverej\u0148uje skuto\u010dn\u00e9 pr\u00edslu\u0161enstvo na Apple Home (spustite ho na paneli ni\u017e\u0161ie).Webov\u00e1/telef\u00f3nna verzia nem\u00e1 \u017eiadny most\u00edk.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; on desktop, {0} built-in HomeKit bridge publishes real accessories to Apple Home (start it from the panel below). The web/phone version has no bridge.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "NEXUS dosiahne va\u0161e zariadenia priamo zo svojej vlastnej aplik\u00e1cie;verzia pre telef\u00f3n/web neobsahuje premostenie HomeKit.Ak ich chcete pou\u017e\u00edva\u0165 s Apple Home (HomeKit), praktick\u00e1 cesta je {0}: pridajte svoje zariadenia do Home Assistant a potom povo\u013ete integr\u00e1ciu HomeKit od HA.", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; the phone/web version does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
    "NEXUS'ta {0} \u00fczerinden Home Assistant'\u0131 ba\u011fla.": "Pripojte Home Assistant cez {0} v NEXUS.", // EN: Connect Home Assistant through {0} in NEXUS.
    "Home Assistant ayarlar\u0131ndan {0} entegrasyonunu ekle; payla\u015fmak istedi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131 se\u00e7.": "V nastaveniach Home Assistant pridajte integr\u00e1ciu {0} a vyberte zariadenia, ktor\u00e9 chcete zdie\u013ea\u0165.", // EN: In Home Assistant settings, add the {0} integration and pick the devices you want to share.
    "\u00d6deme sayfas\u0131nda {0} kullan; abonelik bu e-postayla e\u015fle\u015fir. Deneme s\u00fcresi bitmeden iptal edersen \u00fccret al\u0131nmaz. Aboneli\u011fini Faturaland\u0131rma sayfas\u0131ndan istedi\u011fin an y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Pou\u017eite {0} na platobnej str\u00e1nke;v\u00e1\u0161 odber zodpoved\u00e1 tomuto e-mailu.Zru\u0161te pred skon\u010den\u00edm sk\u00fa\u0161obn\u00e9ho obdobia a nikdy v\u00e1m nebud\u00fa \u00fa\u010dtovan\u00e9 \u017eiadne poplatky.Svoje predplatn\u00e9 m\u00f4\u017eete kedyko\u013evek spravova\u0165 na str\u00e1nke Faktur\u00e1cia.", // EN: Use {0} on the payment page; your subscription is matched to this email. Cancel before the trial ends and you're never charged. Manage your subscription any time from the Billing page.
    "\u015eifre en az {0} karakter olmal\u0131d\u0131r.": "Heslo mus\u00ed ma\u0165 aspo\u0148 {0} znakov.", // EN: Password must be at least {0} characters.
    "Yeni \u015fifre en az {0} karakter olmal\u0131.": "Nov\u00e9 heslo mus\u00ed ma\u0165 aspo\u0148 {0} znakov.", // EN: New password must be at least {0} characters.
    "{0} cihaz bulundu. Eklemek istediklerini se\u00e7.": "Po\u010det n\u00e1jden\u00fdch zariaden\u00ed: {0}.Vyberte tie, ktor\u00e9 chcete prida\u0165.", // EN: Found {0} devices. Pick the ones you want to add.
    "{0} cihaz eklendi. Ana sayfadan y\u00f6netebilirsin.": "Po\u010det pridan\u00fdch zariaden\u00ed: {0}.Spravujte ich na karte Domov.", // EN: Added {0} devices. Manage them from the Home tab.
    "Tekrar g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmek g\u00fczel!{0}Nas\u0131l yard\u0131mc\u0131 olabilirim?": "Som r\u00e1d, \u017ee v\u00e1s op\u00e4\u0165 vid\u00edm!{0}Ako v\u00e1m m\u00f4\u017eem pom\u00f4c\u0165?", // EN: Great to see you again!{0}How can I help?
